  {
    q: 'How much does shipping from China to Ireland cost?',
    a: 'FCL is priced per container at a northern-range benchmark of 20ft $1,200–$4,800 and 40ft $1,600–$6,800 (MEDIUM), while LCL runs $60–$160 per CBM (MEDIUM); Dublin- and Cork-specific figures are not published and must be requested. The planning break-even sits near 15 CBM — below that LCL is usually cheaper, above it FCL starts to win.',
