    q: 'How long does air freight from China to Ireland take?',
    a: 'Not published in the verified snapshot, so request a routing quote rather than assuming a neighbouring figure. Dublin Airport (DUB) is the airfreight entry, and air is the extreme-time option — its value is measured against the cost of roughly 35 days of delay on the sea routing, not against the sea freight rate alone.',
